AltoRewardsDistributor::setMerkleRootTimelock
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new timelock equals current timelock
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when new timelock is different from current timelock
        ├── when setting a normal different timelock
        │   ├── it should update merkle root timelock
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootTimelock event
        ├── when setting zero timelock
        │   ├── it should update merkle root timelock
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootTimelock event
        ├── when increasing timelock
        │   ├── it should update merkle root timelock
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootTimelock event
        ├── when decreasing timelock
        │   ├── it should update merkle root timelock
        │   └── it should emit SetMerkleRootTimelock event
        └── when updating timelock multiple times
            ├── it should update merkle root timelock for each call
            └── it should emit SetMerkleRootTimelock event for each call
